o.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ElbMSg8rarkQ7kNvwGBK_jb&_nc_oc=AdqGxdaY6PluZBlCyGW-r6lYfUAmr2ZOO3ohGhJWMv5_NE5iUAFY6MRrsFJUk3Ff0zU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIdleRun1fqjxPKocxDeXdIt3esw9YlOdnsBmluuC4pCg&oe=6AA3FDA3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FDgADHgYxGAQ7kNvwFdh6r0&_nc_oc=Adq-L2T1ETnOxfyJCmyuijEGSim_Jvborl3yeXDmjt0xDtuNQM4Dhp0zEq5cfwY3Giw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLMqwc98NSMN6je7SVA7NtQttRbxesqHacRXnTu18Avbg&oe=6AA421DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jzJh6ciSu8oQ7kNvwGTIc_W&_nc_oc=AdrIsEVsy3VASBTlrE0gNELFH0-5QOcnCBavZKMjm5jTxsljyVa9cJfqSgH65Df7V_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQh_5uCVoErGrati_Hei3CEb3fjGV55lkD-orHmAoKWw&oe=6AA4104A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818874_1061729115797769_7442033601794403369_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1